[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12546.659, "timestamp": "03:29:06", "text": "我们又在玩坦克兄弟了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12552.71, "timestamp": "03:29:12", "text": "我一直在和它们玩耍。   是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12558.79, "timestamp": "03:29:18", "text": "[笑声]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12561.67, "timestamp": "03:29:21", "text": "这些直播是在互相狙击吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12574.95, "timestamp": "03:29:34", "text": "觉得自己速度够快，可以停下来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12585.19, "timestamp": "03:29:45", "text": "好的。 像这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12586.63, "timestamp": "03:29:46", "text": "什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12588.389, "timestamp": "03:29:48", "text": "我觉得他们不会回复"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12591.19, "timestamp": "03:29:51", "text": "我了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12599.19, "timestamp": "03:29:59", "text": "你只需要占领"}]